	(text "- See if you should use an op amp or hall effect sensor for current sensing (use opamp)\n- How many IDC pins do I need (Talked to Abi and the IDCs come only in even numbers, not odd)\n- Add LEDs\n- Double check power desipated by gate driver (Talked with abi and no need to do so)\n- Calculate bootstrap capacitor\n- Calculte HO pin resistor value\n- Use a voltage divider to measure voltage (Voltage should be less than 3.3V for the MCU)\n"
